<textList name="EVLBL_ROCK_SHIP_SURRENDER">
	<text>[ Rock ship surrender ]

The Rock ship hails: "Enough! We were told aliens were a threat to our ways, and you have proved as much. Take this and leave us in peace."</text>
	<text>[ Rock ship surrender ]

Their systems suffering, the Rock ship attempts to make contact: "Alien vessel. Cease your attack. We will pay."</text>
	<text>[ Rock ship surrender ]

The Rock ship moves into a defensive position and transmits a white flag signal. They seem willing to buy their lives.</text>
